    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Math is both a tool I rely on daily for my studies—like solving equations or analyzing data—and an intellectual puzzle. It feels like a bridge between abstract ideas and practical applications, especially since it’s deeply woven into computer science and sciences that interest me. The discipline keeps me engaged, though sometimes the logical rigor can feel rewarding rather than intimidating, given my parents’ PhDs in STEM.",
